# Plans close their open items

## Decision

Closing a plan closes its items.

## Consequences

- Items stay on disk after they close.
- Confirmation: every plan that reaches develop's done closes the open items linked to it,
  and a failed or cancelled plan returns them to open. A second sentence follows.
-- cmd --
booping specs open-items add --record adr/0099
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: unknown ADR `adr/0099` in the project tier
